  "bodyHash": "rdBxfciMAkA=",
  "content": "<h2><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252ffaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">常见问题</a> | <a style=\"font-size:36px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">致谢</a></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>一款为Minecraft设计的近距离语音聊天模组，附带多种<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a>，提供额外功能与特性。</p><p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>注意</strong>&nbsp;该模组需要在服务器上进行特殊设置才能运行。请阅读<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>了解更多信息。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/4dH2zwTmyX\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_54aa599e-dca8-4985-ab3b-0c7eea6b093a.png\" width=\"300\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>如有疑问，请加入Discord！</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h2>下载</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-game-version=2020709689:10150\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/bukkit-plugins/simple-voice-chat/files/all\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bukkit/Spigot/Paper</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:9153\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quilt</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dvelocity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Velocity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsimple-voice-chat%252fversions%253fl%253dbungeecord\" rel=\"nofollow\">BungeeCord/Waterfall</a></li>\n</ul><h2>功能特性</h2><ul>\n<li>按键通话</li>\n<li>语音激活</li>\n<li>近距离语音聊天</li>\n<li>密码保护群组</li>\n<li>自动语音活动检测</li>\n<li>自动麦克风增益调节</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopus-codec.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Opus编解码器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjmvalin.ca%252fdemo%252frnnoise%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">RNNoise</a>循环神经网络降噪</li>\n<li>OpenAL音频</li>\n<li>Fabric、NeoForge、Forge、Quilt、Bukkit、Spigot和Paper之间的跨平台兼容性</li>\n<li>支持Velocity、BungeeCord和Waterfall</li>\n<li>与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>兼容（使用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">ClothConfig</a>可获得更好的配置界面）</li>\n<li>可配置按键通话键</li>\n<li>麦克风和扬声器测试回放</li>\n<li>可配置语音距离</li>\n<li>耳语模式</li>\n<li>单独调整玩家音量</li>\n<li>麦克风放大</li>\n<li>3D音效</li>\n<li>AES加密</li>\n<li>音频录制及独立音轨</li>\n<li>强大的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fapi\" rel=\"nofollow\">API</a></li>\n<li>众多<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252faddons\" rel=\"nofollow\">附加组件</a></li>\n</ul><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">想要搭建Simple Voice Chat服务器？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://bloom.host/assets/images/Comp_2.gif\"></a></p><div style=\"text-align:center\">在此<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.bloom.host%252faff.php%253faff%253d2\" rel=\"nofollow\">租用</a>您的语音聊天服务器</div><div>\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">更多设置信息请<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.bloom.host%252fmultiplatform%252fsimple-voice-chat%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></div>\n</div>\n</div><h2>图标说明</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>图标</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_f97b8585-e83d-497c-99f5-392cbc0ec617.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在说话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_ce0aca93-3f5d-4780-af3c-ea67cacd2818.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>你正在耳语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_abb579d2-93c9-4b58-98fe-3af74640b927.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在说话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_dbf0ec2c-2894-467f-a12b-783562b3d270.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>玩家正在耳语</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_5c00868a-8177-4285-a834-f7f6182750f3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>麦克风已静音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_8ad963e4-d2c9-48ce-bbc5-86a560107b52.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>语音聊天已禁用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_61dd79be-18cf-4c2a-b062-01a95f2b2159.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\"></td>\n<td>语音聊天未连接<br>语音聊天未安装</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2>图形界面</h2><p>按<code>V</code>键可打开语音聊天图形界面。您可以打开设置、群组聊天、静音自己、禁用语音聊天、开始/停止录音以及隐藏所有图标。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_c2a9809c-f4df-41a0-a0d2-dcf05ce9a32a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><h3>群组聊天</h3><p>群组聊天允许您与不在附近的玩家交谈。要打开群组聊天界面，可以按语音聊天GUI中的群组按钮，或直接按<code>组</code>键。</p><p>要创建新群组，只需在文本框中输入名称，然后按下底部的按钮即可。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_d5f9b725-c5d3-4f21-84d9-4c2666f8cdce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>创建或加入群组将使您进入群组聊天界面。您还会在屏幕左上角看到群组成员的头像。正在说话的玩家头像会被高亮显示。您可以通过按下左数第三个按钮禁用这些图标。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_e7b80129-1beb-4e61-ac59-53b45831481c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"457\"></p><p>未加入群组的玩家会在您的头像旁看到一个群组图标，表明您正在群组中。</p><p>您可以通过输入命令<code>/voicechat invite &lt;玩家名称&gt;</code>或从社交互动界面邀请玩家加入您的群组聊天。</p><h3>设置</h3><p>您可以按<code>V</code>键并按下设置按钮来访问语音聊天设置。</p><p>此菜单提供设置语音聊天音频选项的功能。</p><p>点击麦克风按钮可以测试您的麦克风激活情况。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/416089/description_70d113bb-2d0e-4851-8098-1b63d97c81ce.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><h2>重要说明</h2><p>您需要在服务器上开放一个端口。默认端口为<code>24454</code>的<code>UDP</code>协议。若未开放此端口，语音聊天将无法工作。该端口可以在服务器配置中更改。更多信息请<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrepo.de%252fminecraft%252fvoicechat%252fwiki%252fsetup\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a>。</p><p>语音聊天已加密，但我们不保证其安全性。使用风险自负！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
